# Unicode CLDR 47, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/ko/dateFields.json.  "{0}일 전" / "{0}일 후".
#
# 일 also marks the day of the month (3월 15일) and is the Sino numeral one.
# The readings are told apart by position, never by the string: the day
# marker follows a day number inside a date, the duration unit carries its
# own count and a direction word.
일
